```erb
<footer class="site-footer" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="footer-content">
    <p class="footer-text">
      <%= t('footer.copyright', year: Time.zone.now.year, app_name: ApplicationHelper.application_name) %>
    </p>
    <nav aria-label="Footer links">
      <% footer_links.each do |link| %>
        <%= link_to t(link[:translation_key]), link[:path], class: "footer-link" %>
      <% end %>
    </nav>
  </div>
</footer>
```
